1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Welcome to EventHub, a role-based event management system from Team E7.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Search by keyword, then narrow the results with category and date filters.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Open event details to check the description, schedule, venue, organizer, and spots left.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Sign up as an attendee or organizer; account registration and login are built in.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,000
My Registrations shows confirmed events and offers cancellation to release your place.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The Organizer Studio brings created events, live capacity, and management actions together.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Create an event with category, description, venue, date, time, and participant capacity.

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Edit event details and capacity in place, then save the updated listing.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Review participant names and statuses with confirmed, cancelled, and available totals.

10
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
View occupancy and registration summaries; export the attendee report as CSV.

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Send event announcements directly to registered participants.

12
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Attendees see organizer updates beside their registered events.

13
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Admins monitor platform totals and review roles, account status, and event activity.

14
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Update account roles or suspend and reactivate users from the admin table.

15
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Compare event capacity and utilization, and remove inappropriate events.

